# the beat flash (Steps and Bar, while playing): the paper tints toward coral on a beat, the downbeat more, and is plain
# between beats; nothing when stopped, on another page, with a list open, or with Setup's BEAT FLASH off
wait 300
expect page Steps
expect flash 0
tap PLAY
wait 5
# the first sixteenth is the bar's downbeat: coral at once, 50 % at the peak (32 of 64; 20 a step on)
expect flash >0
expect flashes 1
wait 250
# between the beats: the plain paper
expect flash 0
shot beatflash_rest.png
wait 220
# the second beat (500 ms): 30 % at the peak, less as it fades
expect flash >0
expect flash <20
expect flashes 2
wait 300
expect flash 0
# another page: none, though the beats go on
tap ENV
wait 1200
expect flash 0
expect flashes 2
tap SEQ
wait 20
# a list over Steps: none
tap SEL
expect listopen 1
wait 1200
expect flash 0
tap SEL
wait 20
# Bar, the same
turn SELECT 1
expect page Bar
wait 1100
expect flashes >3
# stopped
tap PLAY
wait 60
expect playing 0
expect flash 0
# the setting, in Setup's list: off, no flash
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row BEAT FLASH
turn ALGO -1
tap HOME
tap SEQ
tap PLAY
wait 2200
expect flash 0
expect flashes 4
tap PLAY
